   95                  | expression GE expression
   96                  | expression LT expression
   97                  | expression LE expression
   98                  | expression BIT_AND expression
   99                  | expression BIT_OR expression
  100                  | expression BIT_XOR expression
  101                  | expression QM expression COLON expression

  102 shortcut_expression: SHORTCUT_PRINTLN element_list

  103 value_expression: INT_LTR
  104                 | FLT_LTR
  105                 | BLN_LTR
  106                 | STR_LTR
  107                 | NLL_LTR
  108                 | function_expression
  109                 | lvalue_expression

  110 lvalue_expression: IDENTIFER
